&lt;h2 id="list-projects"&gt;List Projects&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;code&gt;railway list --json&lt;/code&gt; output can be very large. Run in a subagent and return only essential fields:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Railway Templates</title><link>https://agentskill.wiki/skills/railway-templates/</link><pubDate>Fri, 30 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://agentskill.wiki/skills/railway-templates/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="railway-templates"&gt;Railway Templates&lt;/h1&gt;
